<title>UK: REED WARNS ON STERLING STRENGTH.</title>
<headline>REED WARNS ON STERLING STRENGTH.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-04-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Anglo-Dutch publisher Reed Elsevier said on Wednesday that if the strength of sterling is sustained it will have a &quot;marked effect&quot; on results, particularly in the first half.</p>
</text>
